<title>SWITZERLAND: SNB says leaves discount rate unchanged.</title>
<headline>SNB says leaves discount rate unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss National Bank left its discount rate unchanged at 1.0 percent at a weekly meeting of its policy making board, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>&quot;There was no change,&quot; the spokesman told reporters when asked about the discount rate.</p>
<p>The SNB last changed its discount rate on September 26, when the rate was lowered to 1.00 percent from 1.50 percent. -- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
